#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
msgid "Rotation de token — rétention `McuSecret.previousToken`"
msgstr "Token rotation — `McuSecret.previousToken` retention"

#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Core (2026-07-23) : `internal/heartbeat/server.go` (`validateToken` "
"accepte `token`/`previousToken`, `clearPreviousToken` sur confirmation) +"
" `internal/controller/mcunode_controller.go` (`reconcileTokenRotation`, "
"rejoue `POST /token` tant que non confirmé, Events "
"`TokenRotationApplied`/`TokenRotationFailed`). Déclencheur : écriture "
"atomique `data[\"token\"]`+`data[\"previousToken\"]` dans le Secret par "
"l'opérateur/GitOps (documenté sur `McuNodeSpec.TokenRef`, "
"`api/v1alpha1/mcunode_types.go`). Pas de changement agent (un seul `POST "
"/token` reçu, comme avant). Tests : `TestReconcile_TokenRotation_*` "
"(controller), `TestHandleHeartbeat_{Previous,Current}Token_*` "
"(heartbeat)."
msgstr ""
"Core (2026-07-23): `internal/heartbeat/server.go` (`validateToken` "
"accepts `token`/`previousToken`, `clearPreviousToken` on confirmation) +"
" `internal/controller/mcunode_controller.go` (`reconcileTokenRotation`, "
"replays `POST /token` until confirmed, Events "
"`TokenRotationApplied`/`TokenRotationFailed`). Trigger: atomic write of "
"`data[\"token\"]`+`data[\"previousToken\"]` in the Secret by the "
"operator/GitOps (documented on `McuNodeSpec.TokenRef`, "
"`api/v1alpha1/mcunode_types.go`). No agent change (still a single "
"`POST /token` received, as before). Tests: `TestReconcile_TokenRotation_*`"
" (controller), `TestHandleHeartbeat_{Previous,Current}Token_*` "
"(heartbeat)."

