#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
msgid "NTP fail-closed → device silencieux"
msgstr "NTP fail-closed → silent device"

#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
msgid ""
"Core (2026-07-23) : `internal/heartbeat/server.go` — "
"`HeartbeatPayload.Reason`, `ready` forcé à `false` si "
"`reason==\"clock_unsynced\"` même si "
"`state=running`+`ota_validated=true`, condition `Ready/ClockUnsynced` "
"dédiée (distincte de `HeartbeatTimeout`/`DeviceNotReady`), "
"`LastHeartbeat` mis à jour quand même (pas de silence, §2). Tests : "
"`TestHandleHeartbeat_ClockUnsynced_NotReady`, "
"`TestHandleHeartbeat_NoReason_StillReady`. Agent (2026-07-27) : "
"`main/embewi_heartbeat.c` émet `reason:\"clock_unsynced\"` tant que "
"`!embewi_time_is_set()` et bascule sur `embewi_tls_relaxed_post()` "
"(`main/embewi_tls_relaxed.c`, nouveau — mbedTLS bas niveau, "
"`VERIFY_OPTIONAL` + tolérance limitée à "
"`BADCERT_EXPIRED`/`BADCERT_FUTURE`, chaîne/CN toujours vérifiés). Écart "
"pré-existant corrigé au passage : `CONFIG_MBEDTLS_HAVE_TIME_DATE` n'était"
" activé dans aucun profil de build → la validité temporelle du cert Core "
"n'était vérifiée dans aucun état ; activé en prod "
"(`sdkconfig.defaults.prod`)."
msgstr ""
"Core (2026-07-23): `internal/heartbeat/server.go` — "
"`HeartbeatPayload.Reason`, `ready` forced to `false` if "
"`reason==\"clock_unsynced\"` even when "
"`state=running`+`ota_validated=true`, dedicated `Ready/ClockUnsynced` "
"condition (distinct from `HeartbeatTimeout`/`DeviceNotReady`), "
"`LastHeartbeat` still updated (no silence, §2). Tests: "
"`TestHandleHeartbeat_ClockUnsynced_NotReady`, "
"`TestHandleHeartbeat_NoReason_StillReady`. Agent (2026-07-27): "
"`main/embewi_heartbeat.c` emits `reason:\"clock_unsynced\"` while "
"`!embewi_time_is_set()` and switches to `embewi_tls_relaxed_post()` "
"(`main/embewi_tls_relaxed.c`, new — low-level mbedTLS, "
"`VERIFY_OPTIONAL` + tolerance limited to "
"`BADCERT_EXPIRED`/`BADCERT_FUTURE`, chain/CN always verified). "
"Pre-existing gap fixed along the way: `CONFIG_MBEDTLS_HAVE_TIME_DATE` "
"wasn't enabled in any build profile → the Core cert's temporal validity"
" was never checked in any state; enabled in production "
"(`sdkconfig.defaults.prod`)."

#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
msgid "Découverte de version d'API (`api_versions` dans `GET /info`)"
msgstr "API version discovery (`api_versions` in `GET /info`)"

#: ../../liaison/issues-cross-repo.md
msgid ""
"Core (2026-07-25) : `internal/agent/client.go` — "
"`InfoResponse.ApiVersions`, `agent.NegotiateAPIVersion()` (plus haute "
"version commune ; champ absent → `v1alpha1` supposé, conforme §4) ; "
"`internal/controller/mcudeployment_controller.go` (`persistNodeInfo` "
"négocie à chaque `GET /info` dans `phasePreparing`/`phaseActivating`, "
"stocke le résultat dans `McuNode.Status.ApiVersion`, échec de négociation"
" → `dep.fail(\"APIVersionUnsupported\", …)` + Event Warning, bloque le "
"déploiement plutôt que de tenter un protocole incompatible). Tests : "
"`TestNegotiateAPIVersion_*` (agent), "
"`TestPhasePreparing_UnsupportedAPIVersion_Fails`, "
"`TestPhasePreparing_APIVersionAbsent_NegotiatesV1Alpha1` (controller). "
"Agent (2026-07-27) : `main/embewi_http.c` (`h_info`) émet "
"`\"api_versions\":[\"v1alpha1\"]`."
msgstr ""
"Core (2026-07-25): `internal/agent/client.go` — "
"`InfoResponse.ApiVersions`, `agent.NegotiateAPIVersion()` (highest "
"common version; field absent → `v1alpha1` assumed, per §4); "
"`internal/controller/mcudeployment_controller.go` (`persistNodeInfo` "
"negotiates on every `GET /info` in `phasePreparing`/`phaseActivating`, "
"stores the result in `McuNode.Status.ApiVersion`, negotiation failure →"
" `dep.fail(\"APIVersionUnsupported\", …)` + Warning Event, blocks the "
"deployment instead of attempting an incompatible protocol). Tests: "
"`TestNegotiateAPIVersion_*` (agent), "
"`TestPhasePreparing_UnsupportedAPIVersion_Fails`, "
"`TestPhasePreparing_APIVersionAbsent_NegotiatesV1Alpha1` (controller). "
"Agent (2026-07-27): `main/embewi_http.c` (`h_info`) emits "
"`\"api_versions\":[\"v1alpha1\"]`."

