msgid "§1 Vérification signature (rôle « efficacité » du Core, tableau §1)"
msgstr "§1 Signature verification (Core's \"efficiency\" role, §1 table)"

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md
msgid ""
"✔ (2026-07-25) `internal/oci/client.go` : `WithTrustedPublicKey` "
"(Ed25519) + `verifySignature` vérifient l'annotation manifeste "
"`embewi.io/signature` avant de retourner `FirmwareMeta` — opt-in via "
"`OCI_TRUSTED_PUBLIC_KEY`, no-op si absent (posture dev/MVP). ✔ "
"`StreamBlob` (`*oci.BlobStream`) re-hache les octets réellement reçus au "
"fil de l'eau et les compare au digest attendu (`Err()` → "
"`ErrBlobDigestMismatch`) ; `phaseWriting` (`mcudeployment_controller.go`)"
" vérifie ce résultat après `OTAWrite`, émet `OTABlobDigestMismatch` et ne"
" fait pas avancer vers Activating en cas de divergence — la signature "
"protège le digest *déclaré*, le re-hash protège la correspondance "
"digest↔octets réels"
msgstr ""
"✔ (2026-07-25) `internal/oci/client.go`: `WithTrustedPublicKey` "
"(Ed25519) + `verifySignature` verify the `embewi.io/signature` manifest"
" annotation before returning `FirmwareMeta` — opt-in via "
"`OCI_TRUSTED_PUBLIC_KEY`, no-op if absent (dev/MVP posture). ✔ "
"`StreamBlob` (`*oci.BlobStream`) re-hashes the bytes actually received "
"on the fly and compares them to the expected digest (`Err()` → "
"`ErrBlobDigestMismatch`); `phaseWriting` "
"(`mcudeployment_controller.go`) checks this result after `OTAWrite`, "
"emits `OTABlobDigestMismatch` and does not advance to Activating on "
"mismatch — the signature protects the *declared* digest, the re-hash "
"protects the digest↔actual-bytes correspondence"

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md
msgid ""
"✔ Seule vérification réelle du binaire écrit : SHA-256 incrémental (PSA "
"crypto API) au fil des chunks reçus (`main/embewi_ota.c:25,131-155`), "
"comparé au digest attendu à la finalisation "
"(`embewi_ota_write_finish:160-186`, `digest_mismatch` si divergence) — "
"aucune relecture flash après coup"
msgstr ""
"✔ Only real verification of the written binary: incremental SHA-256 "
"(PSA crypto API) as chunks are received (`main/embewi_ota.c:25,131-"
"155`), compared to the expected digest at finalization "
"(`embewi_ota_write_finish:160-186`, `digest_mismatch` on mismatch) — no"
" flash re-read afterward"

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md
msgid "§1 Rayon d'action d'un token compromis (issue 3)"
msgstr "§1 Blast radius of a compromised token (issue 3)"

