#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md:139
msgid ""
"Cette matrice couvre la conformité **contrat ↔ code Go**, mais pas les "
"manifestes K8s eux-mêmes (`config/`) — angle mort qui a laissé passer "
"trois bugs indépendants du code Go, invisibles aux tests (le fake client "
"`controller-runtime` ne fait pas de *pruning* de schéma CRD comme un vrai"
" apiserver) :"
msgstr ""
"This matrix covers **contract ↔ Go code** compliance, but not the K8s "
"manifests themselves (`config/`) — a blind spot that let three bugs "
"independent of the Go code slip through, invisible to the tests (the "
"`controller-runtime` fake client doesn't do CRD schema *pruning* like a"
" real apiserver):"

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md:145
msgid ""
"✔ **CRD `mcunodes` : `spec.tokenRef` absent du schéma OpenAPI** "
"(`config/crd/bases/embewi.io_mcunodes.yaml`). Un CRD structural sans `x"
"-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields` fait *pruner* silencieusement par "
"l'apiserver tout champ non déclaré à chaque écriture — `tokenRef` aurait "
"été supprimé de tout McuNode appliqué sur un vrai cluster, cassant "
"l'auth/la rotation de token/le push TLS cert (tout ce qui dépend de "
"`Spec.TokenRef`). Invisible dans nos tests car le fake client ne prune "
"pas. Corrigé, ainsi que `status.configGeneration`/`tempCelsius`/ "
"`taskHwmMin` (même CRD, même cause)."
msgstr ""
"✔ **CRD `mcunodes`: `spec.tokenRef` missing from the OpenAPI schema** "
"(`config/crd/bases/embewi.io_mcunodes.yaml`). A structural CRD without "
"`x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields` gets silently *pruned* by the "
"apiserver on any field not declared, on every write — `tokenRef` would"
" have been stripped from every McuNode applied to a real cluster, "
"breaking auth/token rotation/TLS cert push (everything depending on "
"`Spec.TokenRef`). Invisible in our tests because the fake client "
"doesn't prune. Fixed, along with "
"`status.configGeneration`/`tempCelsius`/`taskHwmMin` (same CRD, same "
"cause)."

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md:154
msgid ""
"✔ **CRD `mcudeployments` : `spec.configMapRef` absent du schéma** — même "
"mécanisme, aurait cassé silencieusement toute la fonctionnalité "
"McuConfigMap (§7a) en cluster réel malgré un code Core entièrement "
"fonctionnel et testé. Corrigé."
msgstr ""
"✔ **CRD `mcudeployments`: `spec.configMapRef` missing from the "
"schema** — same mechanism, would have silently broken the entire "
"McuConfigMap feature (§7a) on a real cluster despite fully functional,"
" fully tested Core code. Fixed."

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md:158
msgid ""
"✔ **RBAC** (`config/rbac/role.yaml`) : `secrets` n'avait que "
"`get/list/watch` — `clearPreviousToken` (confirmation de rotation, §4) "
"patch le Secret, aurait échoué en 403."
msgstr ""
"✔ **RBAC** (`config/rbac/role.yaml`): `secrets` only had "
"`get/list/watch` — `clearPreviousToken` (rotation confirmation, §4) "
"patches the Secret, would have failed with 403."

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md:161
msgid ""
"✔ **ServiceMonitor** (`config/monitoring/servicemonitor.yaml`) : "
"namespace `embewi` au lieu de `embewi-system` (Deployment/Service/RBAC), "
"et aucun Service n'exposait de port nommé `metrics` — le pipeline §8b, "
"pourtant entièrement fonctionnel côté code, n'aurait rien eu à scraper."
msgstr ""
"✔ **ServiceMonitor** (`config/monitoring/servicemonitor.yaml`): "
"namespace `embewi` instead of `embewi-system` "
"(Deployment/Service/RBAC), and no Service exposed a port named "
"`metrics` — the §8b pipeline, though fully functional code-side, would"
" have had nothing to scrape."

#: ../../liaison/tracabilite.md:166
msgid ""
"Vérifié par comparaison systématique champ-à-champ (script Python, tags "
"JSON Go vs propriétés OpenAPI des 3 CRD) — les trois schémas "
"correspondent maintenant exactement aux types Go (hors champs de "
"machinerie K8s `metadata`/`items` et champs internes à "
"`metav1.Condition`, absents des structs Go top-level mais présents dans "
"le schéma imbriqué `conditions[]`)."
msgstr ""
"Verified through a systematic field-by-field comparison (Python "
"script, Go JSON tags vs the 3 CRDs' OpenAPI properties) — all three "
"schemas now match the Go types exactly (excluding K8s machinery fields"
" `metadata`/`items` and fields internal to `metav1.Condition`, absent "
"from the top-level Go structs but present in the nested "
"`conditions[]` schema)."

